    "使用說明": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guide"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如專案名稱或客戶名稱。這場會議會移進新資料夾。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example, a project or client name. This meeting will be moved into the new folder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：「上個月跟客戶談過哪些價格？」「寄信的機制最後怎麼決定的？」拾音會先找出相關的會議片段，再請整理工具回答，回答附上是哪一場會議、哪個時間點。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: “What prices did we discuss with clients last month?” or “What did we decide about sending email?” Shiyin first finds the relevant parts of your meetings, then asks the summarizer. Answers show which meeting and what time each point comes from."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：「誰負責寄信的部分？」「最後決定的上線日期是哪一天？」回答只根據這場會議的會議紀錄和逐字稿，每一點都附上時間，點了就能聽原話。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: “Who's handling the email part?” or “What launch date did we settle on?” Answers use only this meeting's notes and transcript, and every point has a time you can click to hear what was said."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：小明": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: Alex"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "依各檔案的檔名或修改日期": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From each file's name or modification date"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "依回答修正中：%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revising from answers: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "依詞彙表和上下文找出可能聽錯的字，標在逐字稿裡，你決定要不要改。不會自動改掉原文。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finds words that were probably misheard, using the glossary and context, and marks them in the transcript for you to decide. The original text is never changed automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
