        }
      }
    },
    "公司的伺服器還沒有提供整理用的模型：請管理者在伺服器後台的「整理模型」加上模型。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The company server doesn't offer a summary model yet. Ask your administrator to add one under Models in the server's admin console."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "公司的伺服器還沒登入或登入已失效，請到設定 → 進階 → 企業伺服器登入": {
