    "從「更多」選「匯出…」（⌘E）：會議紀錄可以存成 Markdown、PDF、Word；逐字稿可以存成 txt、srt、vtt、Word；錄音可以存成 m4a、wav；「整場會議（.shiyin）」可以傳給同事，對方雙擊就能匯入。「複製會議紀錄」可以直接貼到 Notion、Slack 或郵件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose “Export…” (⌘E) from “More”: save meeting notes as Markdown, PDF or Word; the transcript as txt, srt, vtt or Word; the recording as m4a or wav. Send “Whole meeting (.shiyin)” to a colleague, who can double-click it to import. “Copy meeting notes” pastes straight into Notion, Slack or email."
