    },
    "拾音認出這個人的聲音，自動帶入名字。不對的話點名字": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin recognized this person's voice and filled in the name. Click the name if it's wrong."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音：正在打開瀏覽器登入 %@。登入完成後，回到拾音按「重試」或「測試整理工具」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin: opening your browser to sign in to %@. When you’re done, go back to Shiyin and click “Retry” or “Test Summarizer”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「停止並轉錄」後，拾音會在這台 Mac 上重新轉錄（中文、英文用 Breeze ASR 25，日文用 Whisper large-v3-turbo），並分辨不同的說話者。等待的時候，會議紀錄會先用即時逐字稿整理一份草稿，正式版好了會自動換掉。逐字稿上點「說話者 1」可以改成人名，整場都會跟著改；拾音會記住這個人的聲音，之後的會議自動帶入名字（標「自動」，認錯了點一下就能改）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After you press Stop & Transcribe, Shiyin re-transcribes the recording on this Mac (Breeze ASR 25 for Chinese and English, Whisper large-v3-turbo for Japanese) and tells the speakers apart. While you wait, the notes are drafted from the live transcript and replaced automatically once the final version is ready. Click \"Speaker 1\" in the transcript to give them a name and it changes throughout the meeting; Shiyin remembers their voice and fills in the name in later meetings (marked \"auto\"; one click fixes a wrong guess)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「在 GitHub 回報」會用瀏覽器打開新的 issue，並帶入下面的內容，你可以在瀏覽器裡修改後再送出。內容只有版本、環境和錯誤的種類，不包含會議內容、檔名或 API key。沒有 GitHub 帳號的話，可以按「複製」用其他方式寄給維護的人。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Report on GitHub” opens a new issue in your browser with the text below filled in; you can edit it there before submitting. It only contains the version, your setup and the kinds of errors — no meeting content, file names or API keys. If you don’t have a GitHub account, click “Copy” and send it to the maintainer another way."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「錄音」開始，或把錄音檔拖進來。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “Record” to start, or drag in a recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「開始使用」後會打開使用說明，介紹錄音、即時逐字稿、會議紀錄和匯出的用法。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “Get Started” to open the guide, which covers recording, the live transcript, meeting notes and exporting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按工具列的「錄音」（⌘R）開始錄；點按鈕旁的箭頭可以選錄音來源，線上會議請選「麥克風＋電腦聲音（線上會議）」，對方的聲音也會錄進來。已經有錄音檔的話，拖進視窗、按「匯入」（⌘O），或拖到 Dock 上的拾音圖示都可以。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “Record” (⌘R) in the toolbar to start. Click the arrow next to it to choose the source; for online meetings choose “Microphone + computer audio (online meetings)” so the other side is recorded too. If you already have a recording, drag it into the window, click “Import” (⌘O), or drop it on the Shiyin icon in the Dock."
          }
        }
      }
    },
