        }
      }
    },
    "整場逐字稿和之後的會議紀錄都會用這個名字；拾音也會記住這個人的聲音，之後的會議自動帶入。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The whole transcript and future meeting notes use this name. Shiyin also remembers this person's voice and fills in the name in future meetings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summarizing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理、回答待確認、提問、猜說話者時，會把逐字稿文字、你的筆記和詞彙表送到你選的整理工具，錄音檔不會送出。選「不整理」就完全離線。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When summarizing, revising, answering questions or guessing speaker names, the transcript text, your notes and the glossary are sent to the summarizer you chose. The recording is never sent. Choose “Don't summarize” to stay fully offline."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理、提問、猜說話者時會把逐字稿文字、你的筆記、詞彙表和會議基本資料送到 %@。錄音檔不會送出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When summarizing, answering questions or guessing speaker names, the transcript text, your notes, the glossary and basic meeting details are sent to %@. The recording is never sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理、提問、猜說話者時會把逐字稿文字、你的筆記、詞彙表和會議基本資料送到 %@。錄音檔不會送出。用 http 傳送沒有加密，建議改用 https。": {
