      }
    },
    "會參考詞彙表，中英夾雜、專有名詞比較準；聯發科開源的台灣模型，需要下載約 1.7 GB。日文會議改用 Whisper large-v3-turbo（574 MB）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses your glossary, so mixed Chinese-English and proper nouns come out better; MediaTek's open-source Taiwanese model, about 1.7 GB to download. Japanese meetings use Whisper large-v3-turbo (574 MB) instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會參考詞彙表，多人會議的漏字和同音字比 Breeze 少、速度快三成；阿里巴巴開源的模型，全程在這台 Mac 上跑、不連網，輸出會轉成台灣繁體；需要下載約 2.5 GB 的模型。日文會議改用 Whisper large-v3-turbo（574 MB）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses your glossary; drops fewer words in multi-speaker meetings and confuses fewer homophones than Breeze, about 30% faster. An open-source model from Alibaba that runs entirely on this Mac with no network access; Chinese output is converted to Taiwanese Traditional. Requires a 2.5 GB model download. Japanese meetings use Whisper large-v3-turbo (574 MB) instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會打開 %@ 的登入頁，用公司帳號登入。登入後錄音交給公司的伺服器轉錄，整理也用公司設定的模型。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This opens the sign-in page at %@. Sign in with your company account; recordings are then transcribed on your company's server and summarized with your company's model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
