    "說話者": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speaker"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者分得太少（人多、吵雜、手機放在桌上遠距收音）時，從「更多 → 重新處理」選「重新辨識說話者…」，告訴拾音大約幾個人。只會重新分辨誰在說話，逐字稿的文字不會變。錄音中（會議標題右邊的「人數」）或匯入時也可以先選。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Too few speakers detected (many people, noise, or a phone on the table far from everyone)? Choose More → Reprocess → Re-identify speakers… and tell Shiyin roughly how many people there were. Only the speaker labels change; the transcript text stays. You can also set the count while recording (the People control next to the meeting title) or when importing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者分錯了：同一個人被分成兩位，點說話者的名字選「合併到…」；某幾句分錯人，在逐字稿按右鍵選「這句是誰說的」。改錯了，點說話者的名字或按右鍵選「復原」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speakers mixed up? If one person was split into two, click the speaker's name and choose Merge into…; if a few lines went to the wrong person, right-click them in the transcript and choose Who said this. To undo, click the speaker's name or right-click and choose Undo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者可能分得不夠：有些不同的人可能被當成同一位。人多、吵雜或手機放在桌上錄音時常發生，告訴拾音大約幾個人會分得比較準。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some speakers may be missing: different people may have been treated as one. This often happens with many people, noise, or a phone on the table. Telling Shiyin roughly how many people there were helps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
