    "轉錄：錄音會送到 %@（公司的伺服器），轉完就刪。說話者辨識和聲紋在這台 Mac 上做，聲紋、筆記、會議紀錄不會因為轉錄送出。伺服器用的轉錄引擎：%@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription: recordings are sent to %1$@ (your company's server) and deleted after transcription. Speaker identification and voiceprints stay on this Mac; voiceprints, notes and meeting notes are not sent for transcription. Transcription engine on the server: %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
