    "錄下來：現場會議或線上會議，錄音時就有即時逐字稿。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record: in-person or online meetings, with a live transcript while recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄現場會議或你自己的聲音。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record in-person meetings or your own voice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄線上會議對方的聲音用。第一次選「麥克風＋電腦聲音」錄音時 macOS 會詢問，按允許就好。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Captures the other side of online meetings. The first time you record with “Microphone + computer audio”, macOS will ask; just allow it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄線上會議時選「麥克風＋電腦聲音」：你的聲音和對方的聲音會分別錄在左右聲道。第一次錄電腦聲音時，macOS 會詢問「錄製系統音訊」的權限。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For online meetings, choose “Microphone + computer audio”: your voice and the other side are recorded on the left and right channels. The first time you record computer audio, macOS asks for System Audio Recording permission."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄製系統音訊": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System Audio Recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音 %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音、逐字稿和會議紀錄都只存在這台 Mac 上（~/Library/Application Support/Shiyin），不會被 iCloud 同步。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings, transcripts and meeting notes are stored only on this Mac (~/Library/Application Support/Shiyin) and aren't synced to iCloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音一直沒辦法完整傳到企業伺服器": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The recording couldn't be uploaded to the enterprise server completely"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中 15 分鐘沒人說話時提醒你；再 15 分鐘還是沒人說話就自動停止，只轉錄到最後有人說話的地方，錄音檔完整保留。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin reminds you after 15 minutes with nobody talking. After 15 more minutes of silence it stops recording and transcribes only up to the last speech; the full recording is kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中在其他 app 裡也能標記重點": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bookmark while recording, even from another app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中很久沒人說話，拾音自動停止了錄音。要轉錄全部的話，用「更多 → 重新處理 → 重新轉錄」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nobody spoke for a long time, so Shiyin stopped recording. To transcribe everything, use More → Reprocess → Transcribe Again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中按 %@ 標記重點（在其他 app 裡也能用）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While recording, press %@ to mark a highlight (works in other apps too)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中標記重點": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bookmark the moment while recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中畫面左邊是即時逐字稿，講完幾秒內就會出現；右邊「我的筆記」每換一行會自動記下當時的錄音時間（錄完在逐字稿分頁頂部的「我的筆記」還能改）。重要的地方按「標記重點」（⌘B），在其他 app 裡也可以按 ⌃⌥⌘B。需要中斷時按「暫停」（⇧⌘P），暫停的時間不會錄進去。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While recording, the live transcript appears on the left within seconds of speech; My notes on the right stamps the recording time on every new line (you can still edit them later under My notes at the top of the Transcript tab). Press Bookmark (⌘B) at important moments, or ⌃⌥⌘B from any app. Press Pause (⇧⌘P) to take a break; paused time is not recorded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中顯示即時逐字稿": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show live transcript while recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中，點一下打開這場會議": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording. Click to open this meeting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音來源": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording source"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音存檔失敗：%@（檔案還在 %@）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't save the recording: %@ (the file is still at %@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音寫不進磁碟（可能是空間不足），已經停止錄音。停止前錄到的部分有保留，會照常轉錄。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin couldn't write the recording to disk (the disk may be full), so recording has stopped. Everything recorded before that is kept and will be transcribed as usual."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音或匯入": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record or import"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音或轉錄、整理進行中，完成後再更新": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording, transcription or summarizing is in progress. Update when it's done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音時間軸": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording timeline"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音會交給公司的伺服器轉錄。要改回這台 Mac，到「設定 → 進階 → 企業伺服器」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings will be transcribed on your company's server. To switch back to this Mac, go to Settings → Advanced → Enterprise Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音會先存好，下次開啟拾音時開始轉錄。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The recording will be saved and transcribed the next time you open Shiyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音會送到 %@（公司的伺服器）轉錄，轉完就刪；說話者辨識和聲紋在這台 Mac 上做，聲紋不會送出。會參考詞彙表。連不上時會等，也可以改在這台 Mac 轉錄。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings are sent to %@ (your company's server) for transcription and deleted afterwards; speaker identification and voiceprints stay on this Mac. Uses the glossary. If the server can't be reached, Shiyin waits, or you can transcribe on this Mac instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音檔太小，沒有內容": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The recording file is too small and has no content"
