    },
    "錄音的提醒": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording notice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音結束、轉錄完成後，會議紀錄會出現在這裡。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeting notes will appear here after recording and transcription."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音與轉錄": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording & Transcription"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音裡沒有辨識到任何語音": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No speech was found in the recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錯誤代碼 %d": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "error %d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錯誤寫法": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wrong spelling"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鑰匙圈裡已經有舊的 key，macOS 沒有讓拾音取代它。請打開「鑰匙圈存取」，刪除「拾音 API key（%@）」後再存一次。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The keychain already has an older key, and macOS didn’t let Shiyin replace it. Open Keychain Access, delete “Shiyin API key (%@)”, then save again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開 Zoom、Teams、Google Meet 等線上會議時，拾音會提醒你開始錄音；會議好像結束時提醒停止。不想被某個 app 提醒，在提醒上按「不要再提醒」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you join a Zoom, Teams, Google Meet or other online meeting, Shiyin asks whether to start recording, and reminds you to stop when the meeting seems to be over. To stop the reminders for an app, click “Don't Ask for This App” on the reminder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開始": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start"
          }
        }
      }
    },
