    },
    "開始擷取系統聲音": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starting system audio capture"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開始說話後，逐字稿會即時出現在這裡。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The transcript appears here as people speak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開始錄音": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start Recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開始錄音後聽約 10 秒，判斷是中文、英文還是日文；跟會議語言不同而且有把握時會自動切換，錄音畫面可以改回來。需要 60 MB 的語言偵測模型。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After recording starts, listens for about 10 seconds to tell Chinese, English or Japanese apart. If it differs from the meeting language and the result is confident, it switches automatically; you can switch back on the recording screen. Needs the 60 MB language detection model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開始錄音（⌘R），用%@辨識；點右邊的箭頭可以改錄音來源和語言": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start recording (⌘R) in %@; click the arrow to change the recording source and language"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "關": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off"
          }
        }
