            "value": "Microphone Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麥克風沒有收到聲音：可能被靜音、被其他 app 佔用，或選錯了麥克風。可以在設定的「錄音」換一個。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone isn’t picking up any sound. It may be muted, in use by another app, or the wrong microphone. You can choose another one in Settings → Recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麥克風沒有送出聲音，正在重新連接…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone stopped sending audio. Reconnecting…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麥克風沒有送出聲音，重新連接失敗：%@。會繼續重試，錄音沒有停": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
