            "value": "Click to rename this speaker"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "點任何時間點或視窗底部的時間軸就從那裡播放，空白鍵播放或暫停；播放列右邊可以選 0.75×～2× 的速度。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click any time or the timeline at the bottom to play from there; Space plays or pauses. Choose a speed from 0.75× to 2× at the right of the player."
          }
        }
      }
    },
